    /// `isAd`. Filter with `sort`, `price` (1-4) and `open_now`, and collect up to `max_results`
    /// across pages. **Detail** (`mode=detail`): give a business `url` and get a rich object -
    /// phone, full address, website, hours, attributes, categories, specialties, review highlights,
    /// photos and popular dishes.
    ///
    /// `url`: Detail mode: a Yelp business URL or /biz alias, e.g.
    /// '<https://www.yelp.com/biz/gary-danko-san-francisco>'.
    ///
    /// Options are setters on the returned [`YelpBusiness`].
